    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I find math engaging, especially when it connects to real-world applications like coding or physics. As a computer science student, I see its practicality in problem-solving and logic. I enjoy breaking down complex ideas into manageable steps, which helps me stay motivated and curious about new concepts.",
